@startuml
title sunnet.Send 普通服务消息时序

actor "Lua服务A\n业务脚本" as LuaA
participant "LuaApi::Send\nsrc/LuaApi.cpp" as Api
participant "Sunnet\nsrc/Sunnet.cpp" as Sunnet
participant "目标Service B\nService::msgQueue" as SrvB
participant "Worker线程\nsrc/Worker.cpp" as Worker
participant "Service::OnServiceMsg\nsrc/Service.cpp" as OnMsg
participant "Lua服务B\nOnServiceMsg" as LuaB

LuaA -> Api: sunnet.Send(target, ...)
activate Api
Api -> Api: 校验参数数量与 target 类型

alt target 是服务名
    Api -> Sunnet: QueryName(name)
    Sunnet --> Api: targetId / -1
else target 是服务 id
    Api -> Api: targetId = lua_tointeger(1)
end

Api -> Api: 从 registry 读取 __service_id(selfId)

loop 每个 Lua 参数
    Api -> Api: PackValue(...)\n序列化 integer/number/string/table
end

Api -> Api: 构造 ServiceMsg\n type=SERVICE, kind=SEND\n sourse=selfId, session=0
Api -> Sunnet: Send(targetId, msg)
activate Sunnet
Sunnet -> Sunnet: GetService(targetId)

alt 目标服务不存在
    Sunnet --> Api: false\n打印 send failed
    Api --> LuaA: 无返回值
else 找到目标服务
    Sunnet -> SrvB: PushMsg(msg)
    activate SrvB
    SrvB -> SrvB: queueLock 保护入 msgQueue
    SrvB --> Sunnet
    deactivate SrvB

    Sunnet -> SrvB: 检查 inGlobal
    alt Service B 未在 globalQueue
        Sunnet -> Sunnet: PushGlobalQueue(SrvB)\n设置 inGlobal=true
        Sunnet -> Sunnet: checkAndWeakUp()
    else 已在 globalQueue
        Sunnet -> Sunnet: 不重复入全局队列
    end

    Sunnet --> Api: true
    deactivate Sunnet
    Api --> LuaA: 返回 0 个 Lua 值\nSend 异步完成
    deactivate Api

    Worker -> Sunnet: PopGlobalQueue()
    activate Worker
    Sunnet --> Worker: Service B
    Worker -> SrvB: processMsgs(eachNum)
    activate SrvB
    SrvB -> SrvB: PopMsg()
    SrvB -> OnMsg: OnMsg(msg)
    activate OnMsg
    OnMsg -> OnMsg: type == SERVICE\nkind != RET
    OnMsg -> LuaB: StartCallbackCoroutine\nOnServiceMsg(session=0, source, ...)
    activate LuaB
    LuaB --> OnMsg: LUA_OK 或 LUA_YIELD
    deactivate LuaB
    OnMsg --> SrvB
    deactivate OnMsg
    SrvB --> Worker: 本轮处理结束
    deactivate SrvB

    Worker -> Worker: CheckAndPutGlobal(SrvB)
    alt B 队列仍有消息
        Worker -> Sunnet: PushGlobalQueue(SrvB)
    else B 队列为空
        Worker -> SrvB: SetInGlobal(false)
    end
    deactivate Worker
end

note over Api,OnMsg
普通 Send: kind=SEND, session=0, 不等待返回。
CALL/RET 复用 ServiceMsg，但会设置 kind/session 并走协程挂起/恢复。
end note

@enduml
